    "body": "This is looking great! I tested it out locally, and it seems to work very well. 👍 \r\nI would love to see some integration tests added in `src/modules/custom.rs`, much like we have for https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/master/src/modules/nodejs.rs.\r\n\r\nThe only real blocker is that custom modules require `prompt_order` to be set. It would be nice if we could include them in the default `prompt_order` so that users can continue to have modules added to their prompts as they update starship. What are your thoughts?",
